'''Sven Packmaster''' is a [[Slayer]] {{MobCategory|Boss}} in the [[Wolf Slayer]] branch. It is an agile Wolf that deals {{stat|tdmg}}. 

Defeating the {{Stier|4}} Sven Packmaster results in unlocking the [[Enderman Slayer]] quest and the [[Voidgloom Seraph]] boss.

