== Behavior ==
The Sven Packmaster is a Wolf-type mob which is hostile towards all players. It is very fast and has a melee attack.

As with all Slayer bosses, if the Sven Packmaster has not dealt damage to a player for some time, it will begin rapidly regenerating health. The regeneration immediately stops when it hits a player again. Additionally, if either it or its target stays in the same block for too long, it performs a slam-dunk attack, knocking the target towards it and dealing {{Stat|True Damage}}. If 4 minutes pass without the boss being defeated, it will despawn, failing the Slayer quest. A timer is shown above its head indicating the remaining time.

Like the Revenant Horror, if the Sven Packmaster enters the village it will immediately despawn and you will fail the Slayer Quest.

Each tier has all of the abilities from the one before it.
