=== {{SlayerTier|III}} and {{SlayerTier|IV}} ===
Upon reaching 50% health, the Sven Packmaster will begin moving very slowly, and no longer regenerates health{{confirm}}; critical particles appear around it. It spawns 1 Sven Pup at its location every second for 5 seconds, during which it is protected from attacks. Each Sven Pup has 10% of the max health of the Packmaster. When it is spawning pups, the text above its head reads "Calling the pups!", after which it says "Protected". If all the pups are killed, the Packmaster returns to its original behavior. When either the pups or the Packmaster attacked the player, the Packmaster won't regenerate health.

