*It is recommended to unlock {{Coll|Wolf Slayer 2}} as soon as possible in order to unlock the {{Item|Radiant Power Orb}}, one of the most useful items in the game.
**Similarly, it is recommended to achieve Wolf Slayer 3 to unlock [[Maddox Batphone]] which can greatly help in grinding slayers, especially for [[Spider Slayer]] quests which require you to visit a different lobby.
