*This mob's name could be a reference to Sven, the pet wolf in [https://youtube.com/user/PewDiePie PewDiePie's] 2019 [[mcw:Minecraft|''Minecraft'']] series.<!--
*[[Wolf Slayer]] is the only [[Slayer]] that does not have an associated minion.
Note: Trivia should me moved to Wolf Slayer.-->
*The "mad scientist" mentioned in the '''Sven Packmaster'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s lore could possibly be {{NPCSprite|Aura}}.
*All Sven Packmasters are immune to all types of ability damage and ranged damage, including the ability of {{Item|Flower of Truth}}. {{Item|Voodoo Doll}} used to be able to damage the Sven Packmaster but it was shadow-patched. 

